        "content": "## Price drop to Google Sheet\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-listingrail** (Settings > Community Nodes).\n2. Create a Listingrail credential with your API key.\n3. Pick your monitor on the trigger (listingrail.com/monitors/).\n4. Make a sheet whose first row is:\n`checked_at, location, address, beds, old_price, new_price, drop_amount, drop_percent, url, id`\n5. Paste the sheet URL into Append to Google Sheet and activate.",
